WEBVTT

00:01.860 --> 00:03.200
Too soon!

00:11.460 --> 00:13.320
Hello!

01:52.800 --> 01:55.130
Hello, hello! Yeah!

01:55.790 --> 01:58.660
Hi, otaku people! Nice to meet you!

01:58.660 --> 02:02.080
You know about SSC's Four Heavenly Kings?

02:02.080 --> 02:04.270
Well, we lost two of them already...

02:04.730 --> 02:06.510
But we're one of them!

02:06.510 --> 02:07.550
Huh?!

02:08.140 --> 02:11.030
The girl holding me
is my little sister Himawari.

02:11.030 --> 02:13.600
I'm sure you can all see
how adorable she is,

02:13.600 --> 02:15.400
but she's also a little bit shy,

02:15.400 --> 02:17.780
so I'll be doing the talking.

02:22.460 --> 02:26.320
Huh? Hey, I won't take too much time.

02:26.320 --> 02:29.540
Don't you hate it when the principal
goes on long, rambling speeches?

02:29.540 --> 02:33.040
So I'll keep this short.
Your event is now over

02:33.270 --> 02:38.760
because Himawari and I are going to wipe
you and your criminal otaku gang out!

02:45.180 --> 02:45.940
Guys!

02:45.940 --> 02:48.430
Gobo gobo gobo gobo!

02:46.770 --> 02:48.430
"Get everyone to shelter!"

02:52.070 --> 02:53.420
Th-This is bad!

02:53.420 --> 02:54.850
But our big event!

02:54.850 --> 02:56.280
What's gonna happen to us?

02:57.230 --> 02:58.300
Oh, crap!

02:58.820 --> 03:01.840
Don't mess with us!

03:03.360 --> 03:05.440
Everyone, this way! Hurry!

03:11.960 --> 03:14.960
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's wrong, magical girls?

03:14.960 --> 03:17.420
You don't look very happy.

03:17.420 --> 03:18.710
Gobo bobo gobo.

03:18.710 --> 03:20.320
Yeah, I know.

03:20.320 --> 03:22.460
Can't let our guard down with these ones.

03:23.730 --> 03:26.220
That guy is, like, super gross.

03:26.220 --> 03:28.860
Yeah, a nasty talking head.

03:28.860 --> 03:30.480
Shouldn't that be rated R-15?

03:30.480 --> 03:31.550
Gobogobobo.

03:31.550 --> 03:33.480
Huh? Oh, totally, totally.

03:33.810 --> 03:37.730
<b>Moan</b>

03:33.820 --> 03:35.980
My entire life is rated X!

03:35.980 --> 03:37.730
Would you shut up?

03:37.920 --> 03:41.320
When you mess with SSC, you die.

03:41.320 --> 03:44.200
What I mean is,
I'm gonna kill you right now!

03:44.280 --> 03:45.120
Yay!

03:48.500 --> 03:50.120
I always get killed!

03:51.720 --> 03:53.880
Gobo!

03:53.880 --> 03:55.010
Gobo?

03:56.400 --> 03:59.200
If you hit Himawari, she'll get hurt!

04:00.140 --> 04:02.270
That's why I'm trying to hit her!

04:03.340 --> 04:04.730
I said watch out!

04:07.610 --> 04:10.020
You aren't allowed to touch Himawari, okay?

04:10.020 --> 04:12.110
You need to go through me first.

04:12.960 --> 04:16.230
I'm the type that likes
to eat the best part first.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.620
Huh?

04:17.620 --> 04:21.290
Himawari always saves the best for last,
so I guess you won't get along.

04:21.290 --> 04:24.580
All right, let's clean this mess up.

04:24.580 --> 04:26.820
Himawari, go ahead.

04:36.510 --> 04:39.660
Dumbass!

04:44.050 --> 04:47.770
Otaku Hero, can Blue and Pink handle this?

04:48.420 --> 04:52.460
I'm not sure, but we've got
to believe in them.

04:54.160 --> 04:55.820
What is this guy's deal?

04:55.820 --> 04:58.130
Gobobo. Gobo bobo gobo.

04:58.130 --> 04:59.820
Which one do we take out?

04:59.820 --> 05:01.690
We've got to get both of them!

05:01.690 --> 05:04.790
But why is he only a severed head?

05:04.790 --> 05:07.950
I could tell you, but it's a long story.

05:07.950 --> 05:09.200
Gobo bobobo!

05:07.950 --> 05:09.200
"Keep it short!"

05:10.060 --> 05:12.820
I died by Himawari's hand.

05:13.780 --> 05:15.460
What's that supposed to mean?

05:15.460 --> 05:18.720
Or maybe I should say,
I asked her to kill me.

05:18.720 --> 05:22.220
Because I really, really,
really love her so much!

05:22.220 --> 05:25.180
Whoa, aren't you talking about ince—!

05:26.140 --> 05:28.510
I'd ask you to keep your
dirty fantasies to yourself.

05:28.680 --> 05:34.020
But it was always my dream.
To have Himawari kill me.

05:35.100 --> 05:40.520
Ever since Himawari was born,
my whole life revolved around her.

05:40.710 --> 05:44.000
I lived for Himawari,
and I would die for her.

05:44.000 --> 05:47.200
I felt like that was
the entire reason I was born!

05:47.530 --> 05:49.160
Wow, that's pretty heavy.

05:49.370 --> 05:51.750
But doesn't the little girl
have something to say about it?

05:51.750 --> 05:54.110
Himawari and I are bound by our love.

05:54.110 --> 05:56.420
We're connected telepathically,
so we feel the same way.

05:56.420 --> 05:58.170
I wasn't asking you.

05:58.360 --> 06:01.310
You don't need to ask her. I'm her brother.

06:01.310 --> 06:03.660
Which means you must've made her do it.

06:03.660 --> 06:05.050
Gobo bobo gobo.

06:05.050 --> 06:09.100
Yeah, I figured you wouldn't get it.
It has nothing to do with you anyway.

06:09.100 --> 06:12.420
But for me and Himawari, this is love.

06:12.420 --> 06:15.810
Aren't y'all gettin' enough love?

06:23.910 --> 06:26.870
Confusion (Alternative Mix)!

06:30.480 --> 06:31.280
Pink!

06:31.450 --> 06:33.640
Gobo gobo, gobo!

06:36.120 --> 06:37.460
Go-bo!

06:39.410 --> 06:41.170
I won't let you touch Himawari!

06:45.930 --> 06:48.430
Wow. You're such a caring, devoted brother.

06:48.430 --> 06:52.860
Yeah, of course I am!
Himawari made my dream come true!

06:53.180 --> 06:56.440
So that's why this time
I'm putting all my body and soul

06:56.440 --> 07:00.230
into making Himawari's dreams come true, too!

07:00.230 --> 07:02.100
Gobo gobo gobo gobo!

07:01.140 --> 07:02.100
"You don't even have a body!"

07:02.310 --> 07:03.970
Yeah, guess you're right about that!

07:15.530 --> 07:17.080
What's wrong, sweetie?

07:20.830 --> 07:22.490
Oh, I see.

07:22.490 --> 07:24.320
But you have nothing to worry about.

07:24.320 --> 07:26.340
Just leave everything to Shobon-sama.

07:27.200 --> 07:31.590
If you're willing to help us out,
I'll bring your brother back to life.

07:31.800 --> 07:34.840
I'm sure he'll make your wish come true.

07:34.840 --> 07:37.100
Don't you want to stay
with your brother forever?

07:37.930 --> 07:40.100
Just trust Shobon-sama.

07:40.540 --> 07:41.380
Okay?

07:55.960 --> 07:58.950
Now be sure to do to what Shobon-sama says,

07:59.140 --> 08:02.300
<i>or else your brother will have to go away.</i>

08:04.650 --> 08:07.720
Yeah, time to wrap things up.

08:09.130 --> 08:11.220
<b>O
T
OTAKU
K
U</b>

08:15.070 --> 08:17.540
Anarchy-chan, take care of everyone!

08:24.860 --> 08:27.860
Deeper, deeper, deeper!

08:27.860 --> 08:29.860
Deeper, deeper, deeper, deeper, deeper!

08:31.860 --> 08:34.650
Deeper, deeper, deeper,
deeper, deeper, deeper, deeper!

08:38.400 --> 08:39.220
Fire!

08:39.220 --> 08:41.240
We've got to save Blue-chan and Pink-chan!

08:42.720 --> 08:44.490
Oh, shut up!

08:48.000 --> 08:49.210
Retreat! Retreat!

08:49.210 --> 08:50.460
Then, eat this!

08:52.710 --> 08:53.380
Otaku
<b>Canned Oden</b>

08:53.380 --> 08:54.520
Huh?

08:55.160 --> 08:56.270
Too bright!

09:00.000 --> 09:01.630
Otaku Hero-sama!

09:04.210 --> 09:05.720
Are you two okay?

09:05.720 --> 09:07.720
Gobo bobobo?

09:06.380 --> 09:07.720
"What does it look like?"

09:08.040 --> 09:09.230
Gobo!

09:09.230 --> 09:11.730
Gobo bobo! Gobo bobobo!

09:10.040 --> 09:11.730
Huh? What is it?

09:11.730 --> 09:14.260
She said, "give me the drugs."

09:14.260 --> 09:15.240
The drugs?

09:15.840 --> 09:18.240
Gobobo...

09:19.740 --> 09:22.200
You sure the stuff's good?

09:22.200 --> 09:23.000
We're not.

09:24.080 --> 09:25.870
But it's now or never.

09:26.050 --> 09:28.380
Gobo gobo...

09:26.720 --> 09:28.380
"We have to power up."

09:39.140 --> 09:40.020
Pee-yew!

09:40.630 --> 09:41.540
Here we go.

09:41.540 --> 09:42.510
Gobo.

09:42.690 --> 09:43.760
Barf.

09:47.680 --> 09:48.620
Ehh...

09:57.280 --> 09:59.930
Girls! If it's bad, then spit it out!

10:01.790 --> 10:03.840
Blue-chan! Pink-chan!

10:24.090 --> 10:27.800
Blue-chan! Pink-chan! Hang in there!

10:29.410 --> 10:31.230
Ah, there you are.

10:31.230 --> 10:33.260
Don't run away like that!

10:34.090 --> 10:36.740
Those two in the back look pretty messed up.

10:37.320 --> 10:39.130
Well then, goodbye.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.280
Blue-chan?

10:46.280 --> 10:47.360
Oh, stop!

10:47.360 --> 10:50.590
I'm sorry, sir, but you
aren't allowed to touch the girls.

10:51.830 --> 10:52.710
All right!

10:52.710 --> 10:54.500
Go-bo!

10:56.460 --> 10:57.670
Pink-chan!

10:57.670 --> 11:00.080
Gobo gobo! Gobobobo!

10:58.190 --> 11:00.800
"I'm feeling stronger than ever before!"

11:00.800 --> 11:03.060
Now it's our showtime!

11:03.060 --> 11:05.800
Gobo!

11:10.050 --> 11:11.080
Uh...

11:11.710 --> 11:14.430
I-Is this stuff really...

11:15.040 --> 11:16.040
okay?

11:18.260 --> 11:20.940
Gobo! Bobo. Gobo gobo!

11:20.940 --> 11:22.930
What are those gross things?

11:22.930 --> 11:25.200
From the colors, are they Blue and Pink?

11:25.540 --> 11:28.120
What the hell are they doing?

11:28.120 --> 11:30.580
Things are gonna be different now.

11:30.580 --> 11:31.720
Gobo, gobo!

11:31.720 --> 11:35.840
Yeah, looks like you got a little stronger,
but will that really help?

11:36.220 --> 11:40.040
Do your trash talking now,
while you still can!

11:40.850 --> 11:42.720
Gobo!

11:42.720 --> 11:44.600
Huh? What's that?

11:44.600 --> 11:46.390
Yeah, I'm saying...

11:46.920 --> 11:49.840
Would you shut up for one minute?

12:03.970 --> 12:05.580
Ooh!

12:06.240 --> 12:09.360
Amazing! This is the drug Chogo-shi made?

12:09.360 --> 12:11.120
It can't be good for you.

12:11.310 --> 12:13.750
So once again, it's showtime!

12:13.750 --> 12:15.000
Gobo!

12:18.010 --> 12:19.840
Himawari, don't hold back!

12:20.760 --> 12:22.640
Huh? Eh? Ehh?

12:23.750 --> 12:25.640
Um, what?

12:26.670 --> 12:28.140
Himawari?

12:28.770 --> 12:32.140
Ah! Ow ow ow ow!
Ouch, that hurts! That hurts!

12:33.040 --> 12:36.190
Owie. That hurt your brother a little.

12:36.720 --> 12:39.570
Wh-What's wrong, Himawari?

12:39.570 --> 12:40.540
Chance!

12:41.270 --> 12:42.280
Gobobo!

12:42.280 --> 12:44.530
Himawari! Ah, ouch!

12:44.530 --> 12:46.560
Hey, I'm busy over here!

12:46.560 --> 12:49.990
Why are you feeling grumpy?

12:50.970 --> 12:52.910
Did your big brother do something wrong?

12:53.450 --> 12:55.650
Fine, just wait a minute.

12:55.650 --> 12:57.670
We can talk when it's all over. Okay?

12:57.670 --> 12:59.980
Is this really the time to be quarreling?

13:00.010 --> 13:01.880
Would you quit getting in my way?!

13:06.180 --> 13:08.120
Oh, very nice catch.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.320
Yeah, ball play is my thing.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.560
Just kidding, though!

13:11.560 --> 13:12.320
Heh.

13:13.710 --> 13:14.690
Gobo!

13:19.060 --> 13:20.680
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

13:20.680 --> 13:23.190
What the hell is this tongue?
You're disgusting.

13:23.190 --> 13:26.770
You shouldn't throw around
the word "disgusting" so easily.

13:26.770 --> 13:28.950
Most folks would feel harmed by that!

13:28.950 --> 13:32.620
Oh, yeah? But some people
would get turned on!

13:35.150 --> 13:38.360
Confusion (Essential Mix)!

13:38.750 --> 13:40.380
Aah! That's disgusting!

13:40.380 --> 13:42.540
Thank you very much, Master!

13:42.540 --> 13:44.460
Pee-yew! What the hell?!

13:44.460 --> 13:46.540
Hey, cut it out! Pew!

13:46.540 --> 13:48.220
You stinking stink of stink!

13:47.200 --> 13:48.220
Consider that my

13:48.220 --> 13:51.200
p-r-e-s-e-n-t. {spoken as "p-re-se-n-t"}

13:54.350 --> 13:55.850
Damn it!

13:56.800 --> 13:58.230
Nice one!

13:58.230 --> 14:00.160
Wait, Otaku Hero!

14:00.910 --> 14:02.880
Did something happen to Blue and Pink?

14:02.880 --> 14:03.810
Yeah.

14:03.810 --> 14:06.610
They used the power-up drug from Chogo-shi.

14:06.610 --> 14:07.650
Huh?!

14:07.650 --> 14:11.550
But you sure that's good?
Powering up all of a sudden.

14:11.550 --> 14:12.610
What do you mean?

14:12.610 --> 14:17.250
Well, if you get that strong that quick,
you could have a bad reaction.

14:18.400 --> 14:20.120
Bad reaction?

14:24.880 --> 14:28.890
That was the worst present ever.
I don't appreciate it one bit!

14:28.890 --> 14:32.890
Well, that's just too bad.
I really put my love into it.

14:32.890 --> 14:36.640
Hate to be rude, but I get more than
enough love from Himawari.

14:36.640 --> 14:38.910
Gobo! Gobobo! Gobo gobo gobo bo!

14:38.910 --> 14:40.360
I hear you.

14:40.360 --> 14:43.520
We have to get the head,
or we'll run out of magic.

14:43.880 --> 14:46.280
But the head is so small...

14:46.280 --> 14:48.150
Oh, I know! Listen here.

14:48.150 --> 14:49.150
Gobo?

14:49.470 --> 14:53.240
A strategy meeting?
What's the point of that now?

14:53.240 --> 14:55.000
It's gonna be a surprise!

14:55.000 --> 14:57.160
You aren't supposed to tell me that!

14:57.160 --> 15:00.710
Gobo! Gobobobo, gobo!

15:01.420 --> 15:03.160
Gobo!

15:01.420 --> 15:03.170
"Fire!"

15:03.170 --> 15:05.920
You think that's gonna beat me?

15:09.020 --> 15:09.570
Huh?

15:09.570 --> 15:11.520
Then, how about this?!

15:14.080 --> 15:14.920
Gobo!

15:14.920 --> 15:16.310
All right!

15:14.920 --> 15:16.310
Gobo-bo!

15:19.320 --> 15:21.830
The hell you think you're doing?

15:21.830 --> 15:23.310
Huh? What just happened?

15:23.310 --> 15:25.000
You're too small as a head,

15:25.000 --> 15:27.070
Gobobobo, gobo!

15:25.560 --> 15:27.690
"So we gave you a body! Yeah!"

15:27.690 --> 15:30.700
Whaaat?! But I'm a guy!

15:31.080 --> 15:33.890
H-Himawari, your brother just got a body!

15:33.890 --> 15:35.440
But it's a girl's body!

15:35.440 --> 15:38.700
I'm not your brother
anymore. I'm your sister!

15:39.070 --> 15:43.320
But now I can move on my own like I used to!

15:43.320 --> 15:46.360
I suddenly feel so free!

15:46.360 --> 15:47.840
All right, here I go.

15:47.840 --> 15:50.550
Squishy, squishy, squishy, squishy, boiiing!

15:51.010 --> 15:54.960
What the hell? Now he's even worse!

15:53.460 --> 15:55.280
Gobobo, gobo-go!

15:55.280 --> 15:58.600
We won't know if the plan worked
or not until we're done!

15:58.810 --> 16:00.220
I wonder about that.

16:04.240 --> 16:06.860
I hate to do this
while you're all powered up,

16:06.860 --> 16:10.490
but it looks like you
powered me up, too! Bah!

16:12.240 --> 16:13.480
Gobo!

16:13.480 --> 16:14.520
Heh!

16:17.270 --> 16:18.870
Gobobo bobobo!

16:18.870 --> 16:21.800
I know! You don't have to keep yelling!

16:22.360 --> 16:25.120
What's wrong? Are we already done?

16:25.120 --> 16:27.470
There's no way we'd be that premature.

16:27.470 --> 16:28.460
Gobobo!

16:28.460 --> 16:29.500
Huh...

16:29.500 --> 16:33.760
But check out the shit I can do now!

16:33.760 --> 16:34.510
Gobo!

16:33.760 --> 16:34.510
Gross!

16:37.760 --> 16:38.930
Aw, crud!

16:38.930 --> 16:41.600
Blue and Pink used up too much magic!

16:43.400 --> 16:44.660
Gobo-bo...

16:47.570 --> 16:48.480
Hmm!

16:48.480 --> 16:51.400
Sure feels good to flex
your muscles once in a while!

16:51.730 --> 16:54.160
Well then, how about we wrap this up?

16:54.160 --> 16:55.890
It's already taken too long.

16:57.110 --> 16:58.780
Ohhryah!

16:58.830 --> 17:00.160
Get 'em!

17:04.480 --> 17:06.190
I don't care if you tag in,

17:06.190 --> 17:09.060
but you still realize you're
no match for me, right?

17:09.060 --> 17:11.800
I won't know that unless I try!

17:11.800 --> 17:14.300
The other girls said the same thi—

17:24.460 --> 17:25.930
Himawari?

17:30.130 --> 17:32.460
B-But why?

17:35.730 --> 17:42.660
Today, because my brother
asked me to, I killed him.

17:44.520 --> 17:46.370
I didn't wanna do it,

17:46.370 --> 17:49.670
but I love my brother a bunch,
and he asked me to.

17:50.110 --> 17:52.860
Then he came back.

17:52.860 --> 17:56.910
Why had I gotten all sad about it?

17:57.460 --> 18:00.980
Not fair. I don't think he was being fair.

18:01.430 --> 18:03.740
I wanted him to kill me, too...

18:03.740 --> 18:07.130
Not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair,
not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair,

18:07.130 --> 18:10.680
not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair,
not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair!

18:16.290 --> 18:18.240
I'm sorry, Himawari.

18:18.870 --> 18:22.450
I guess I had trouble
understanding a girl's feelings.

18:22.450 --> 18:24.110
Brother!

18:38.600 --> 18:40.880
These are some sick siblings.

18:40.880 --> 18:44.000
Are that brother and sister
trying to kill Anarchy?

18:44.000 --> 18:46.670
I'm supposed to get to kill her!

18:47.710 --> 18:50.760
Hmm. This wasn't part of the plan.

18:51.200 --> 18:52.960
Was it just instinct?

18:52.960 --> 18:56.530
Or did they somehow develop consciousness?

19:06.540 --> 19:08.540
How do we handle that thing?!

19:08.540 --> 19:12.170
Just do whatever you...
nah, you're screwed.

19:12.170 --> 19:13.550
But at this point...!

19:13.550 --> 19:16.430
A love so strong you
want to kill each other?

19:16.430 --> 19:17.460
Love sure hur—

19:20.180 --> 19:21.010
Kyotaro!

19:21.010 --> 19:22.500
Forget about him!

19:28.420 --> 19:32.390
Since they merged,
they can only move together,

19:32.390 --> 19:34.480
so they should die together, too!

19:34.480 --> 19:36.980
If you're that desperate to stay together,

19:37.190 --> 19:39.240
then eff off and die.

19:47.480 --> 19:49.000
Brother!

19:50.230 --> 19:52.170
Himawari.

20:05.560 --> 20:07.010
Isn't that...?

20:08.560 --> 20:12.610
You guys always think you can run the show.

20:12.960 --> 20:15.020
I've about had it with you.

20:15.370 --> 20:18.520
Right now, right here,
I am going to kill you!

20:24.790 --> 20:26.610
Hi, this is Slayer.

20:26.610 --> 20:29.260
Slayer. C'mon home now.

20:29.870 --> 20:33.370
But, Shobon-sama,
I was just about to do these—

20:33.370 --> 20:35.410
No, you're coming home.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.630
You know I don't like selfish girls.

20:37.850 --> 20:39.880
<i>Your part comes tomorrow.</i>

20:39.880 --> 20:43.650
<i>Why don't you just tell them
to prepare for death?</i>

20:43.650 --> 20:45.090
All right.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.980
I'll give you a single day.

20:49.800 --> 20:54.800
When that day is up, I'll take you
magical girls, you otaku and whatever,

20:54.800 --> 20:58.300
and slaughter, destroy,
and crush all of you!

20:58.300 --> 21:00.600
So until then, shiver in fear

21:00.600 --> 21:03.940
and make peace with whatever
imaginary gods you have!

21:22.240 --> 21:26.700
I-It feels like she could've
killed us at any second.

21:26.700 --> 21:29.900
And then making us wait for it...

21:30.730 --> 21:35.720
If they always had this much power,
were they always toying with us?

21:35.720 --> 21:37.220
It's okay, guys!

21:37.220 --> 21:40.100
Even if that's their plan,
our job here hasn't changed!

21:40.100 --> 21:42.480
It just means it's time to settle things!

21:43.860 --> 21:45.490
What's wrong?

21:45.660 --> 21:47.900
Let's work together!

21:47.900 --> 21:51.910
Don't we always get up
and try again every time?

21:51.910 --> 21:54.240
Don't we? Guys?

23:25.530 --> 23:27.670
Your heart beats with silence.

23:27.670 --> 23:29.410
The rhythm dies down.

23:29.410 --> 23:33.670
Destruction pierces through your body
like an unavoidable rain storm.

23:34.020 --> 23:35.400
But even then,

23:35.400 --> 23:39.930
you must face the darkness, shoot,
and run toward the light.

23:39.930 --> 23:41.930

